          modified: 1767225600000
          isPrivate: false
          description: The seeded admin's order, requested with whatever token the collection holds. As the non-admin this is the cross-tenant read the API must refuse; as the admin it is a legitimate one. Same URL, two answers — which is the whole of role scoping in one request.
